    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring-measurement-passive-linear-rc-g-ca-0-k-gate-frozen-hotspot-superposition-ratio-v-pair-v-a-v-b> a schema:PropertyValue,
