        dcterms:description "15 reference-anchored measurements with Pearson r, p-values, OLS SE, RMSE, random-tree ablation and the passive g_Ca = 0 / frozen-K+ ablations; Pass 3 block L1281-1342" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/2007-caleo-cajal-dendritic-wiring.py#L1163-L1342> .

